151
00:12:07,610 --> 00:12:09,940
Japanese Youth

152
00:12:27,790 --> 00:12:28,920
Damn it.

153
00:12:36,800 --> 00:12:38,720
You've cried enough, boys.

154
00:12:43,680 --> 00:12:46,060
You used all your strength.

155
00:12:46,270 --> 00:12:51,570
In your football careers, you have plenty of time to make up for defeat.

156
00:12:51,860 --> 00:12:53,690
Don't hang your heads.

157
00:12:54,320 --> 00:12:57,490
Today, I'm disbanding the German youth.

158
00:12:58,240 --> 00:13:01,120
But the next youth team...

159
00:13:01,200 --> 00:13:06,540
...and then the senior national team eagerly await all of you.

160
00:13:08,790 --> 00:13:11,000
Your future starts now.

161
00:13:11,460 --> 00:13:15,420
Be motivated by this defeat and keep working hard.

162
00:13:15,550 --> 00:13:16,590
Yes, coach.

163
00:13:35,030 --> 00:13:36,110
Karl.

164
00:13:45,660 --> 00:13:47,080
I know it's a disappointment.

165
00:13:47,960 --> 00:13:48,830
I'm sorry.

166
00:13:49,120 --> 00:13:52,250
You came all this way to support me and...

167
00:13:52,840 --> 00:13:53,840
...I couldn't win.

168
00:13:56,550 --> 00:14:00,590
It's okay. You gave it your all.

169
00:14:06,720 --> 00:14:09,100
You can make up for it whenever you want.

170
00:14:09,350 --> 00:14:11,230
You're still young.

171
00:14:11,600 --> 00:14:14,360
You'll have plenty of opportunities.

172
00:14:15,440 --> 00:14:16,280
Yes.

173
00:14:18,860 --> 00:14:24,620
And also, this now gives special meaning to your training.

174
00:14:27,660 --> 00:14:30,370
And I will be a coach in Munich.

175
00:14:30,920 --> 00:14:33,330
Coach? Really?

176
00:14:33,670 --> 00:14:36,300
It was a request from Coach Falster.

177
00:14:36,500 --> 00:14:37,800
From the coach?

178
00:14:38,010 --> 00:14:41,090
And I accepted.

179
00:14:46,560 --> 00:14:48,930
Your mother and Marie are coming too.

180
00:14:52,650 --> 00:14:54,020
So...

181
00:14:54,610 --> 00:14:59,030
Yes. We can be a family together again now.

182
00:15:01,200 --> 00:15:02,320
Dad.

183
00:15:05,240 --> 00:15:06,080
Oh.

184
00:15:07,080 --> 00:15:08,080
Dad...

185
00:15:09,040 --> 00:15:10,750
I'm returning this to you.

186
00:15:14,880 --> 00:15:18,550
Actually, your mother gave this to you.

187
00:15:18,880 --> 00:15:20,210
So I think the best thing is...

188
00:15:21,840 --> 00:15:23,890
...to put it around your neck.

189
00:15:26,010 --> 00:15:27,310
Right.

190
00:15:36,770 --> 00:15:37,820
Dad...

191
00:15:39,150 --> 00:15:41,900
I'm so happy, Dad.

192
00:15:44,860 --> 00:15:49,950
It looks like Captain Tsubasa is going to give an interview.

193
00:15:47,910 --> 00:15:50,910
Japan Won!

194
00:15:51,290 --> 00:15:57,920
Congratulations on Japan's victory and on being chosen as the Most Valuable Player.

195
00:15:58,460 --> 00:15:59,960
Thank you very much.

196
00:16:00,710 --> 00:16:05,800
I thank everyone for their incredible support.

197
00:16:09,060 --> 00:16:12,180
Now that the final match is over, how do you feel?

198
00:16:12,640 --> 00:16:18,190
Yes. Before the tournament, we made a promise to each other.

199
00:16:19,020 --> 00:16:21,650
We truly wanted to become champions in this tournament.

200
00:16:21,730 --> 00:16:25,240
We are truly very happy that this dream has come true.

201
00:16:25,320 --> 00:16:28,070
It was a wonderful match.

202
00:16:28,200 --> 00:16:34,210
I think many people have realized how much Japanese football has progressed.

203
00:16:34,620 --> 00:16:38,460
Thank you very much, but we still have a long way ahead.

204
00:16:38,920 --> 00:16:42,880
Today's victory is a starting point for us.

205
00:16:43,340 --> 00:16:47,260
And this was a big step for me.

206
00:16:47,890 --> 00:16:52,180
Because in the world, there are many strong football countries like Brazil...

207
00:16:52,270 --> 00:16:56,270
...which you could call the kingdom of football.

208
00:16:57,270 --> 00:17:00,480
I've had a dream since my childhood.

209
00:17:00,940 --> 00:17:02,480
And what is that?

210
00:17:03,360 --> 00:17:05,650
I want to play against teams from all around the world.

211
00:17:06,320 --> 00:17:10,030
I want to learn football from them.

212
00:17:10,580 --> 00:17:13,240
I want to play against the strongest.

213
00:17:13,790 --> 00:17:15,500
And I want to do this with the help of my friends.

214
00:17:16,250 --> 00:17:18,620
This is my dream.

215
00:17:19,040 --> 00:17:20,840
And I am free to follow my dream.

216
00:17:21,420 --> 00:17:25,880
Chasing your dreams is never in vain.

217
00:17:26,130 --> 00:17:29,260
I think that's a wonderful thing.

218
00:17:29,720 --> 00:17:35,270
Because today, I am convinced that it was not an empty dream.

219
00:17:35,810 --> 00:17:38,350
Because today's victory was linked to our dream...

220
00:17:38,440 --> 00:17:42,820
...of putting Japanese football at the top of the world.

221
00:17:43,900 --> 00:17:45,740
I promise...

222
00:17:46,690 --> 00:17:52,660
...our generation will carry Japanese football to the top.

223
00:17:53,580 --> 00:18:00,540
I... we... will keep running to reach this dream.

224
00:18:18,890 --> 00:18:20,020
Roberto-san.

225
00:18:22,270 --> 00:18:23,940
If you want to go forward...

226
00:18:25,020 --> 00:18:25,940
Take this.

227
00:18:30,490 --> 00:18:32,570
Do you want to see Tsubasa?

228
00:18:36,540 --> 00:18:37,540
Thanks.

229
00:18:45,800 --> 00:18:49,010
When I met the Japanese football boy Tsubasa...

230
00:18:49,260 --> 00:18:51,760
...I taught him football.

231
00:18:51,840 --> 00:18:56,970
And he taught me the beauty of dreaming and the joy of living.

232
00:18:57,350 --> 00:19:00,940
Tsubasa taught me the joy and beauty of teaching football.

233
00:19:01,020 --> 00:19:04,190
Even when I could no longer play.

234
00:19:04,730 --> 00:19:05,940
Even so...

235
00:19:06,400 --> 00:19:08,400
When he won the National Championship...

236
00:19:08,570 --> 00:19:12,360
...I told him I would take him to the kingdom of football, Brazil.

237
00:19:12,610 --> 00:19:14,320
Then I kept my word.

238
00:19:15,580 --> 00:19:17,790
Forgive me, Tsubasa.

239
00:19:19,410 --> 00:19:25,130
Back then, I didn't have the confidence or the courage to do it.

240
00:19:43,690 --> 00:19:44,900
Roberto.

241
00:19:45,520 --> 00:19:46,520
Tsubasa.

242
00:19:48,110 --> 00:19:50,610
Roberto? What are you doing here?

243
00:19:52,610 --> 00:19:54,740
Congratulations on your victory, Tsubasa.

244
00:19:55,820 --> 00:19:58,910
Is your eye... is your eye okay?

245
00:19:59,330 --> 00:20:01,700
Yes, it's fine.

246
00:20:02,580 --> 00:20:04,790
Roberto, I...

247
00:20:04,870 --> 00:20:09,920
After I graduate from school, I want to go to Brazil.

248
00:20:10,710 --> 00:20:13,840
I watched your game today.

249
00:20:14,720 --> 00:20:19,430
The first skill I taught you in Japan was an overhead kick rebounding from the crossbar.

250
00:20:20,770 --> 00:20:25,520
You adapted well to the situation and scored the winning goal.

251
00:20:26,150 --> 00:20:27,440
It was incredible.

252
00:20:29,690 --> 00:20:31,030
That's not all.

253
00:20:31,440 --> 00:20:34,110
As a midfielder, you set up the play...

254
00:20:34,490 --> 00:20:36,740
...and as captain, you united the team.

255
00:20:37,410 --> 00:20:39,870
All of this was extraordinary.

256
00:20:40,870 --> 00:20:43,870
You've really grown, Tsubasa.

257
00:20:44,960 --> 00:20:47,790
For your dream of becoming the best footballer in the world...

258
00:20:48,670 --> 00:20:50,800
...will you let me help you?

259
00:20:55,170 --> 00:20:56,720
Roberto!

260
00:20:59,430 --> 00:21:04,350
So, will you teach me your football again?

261
00:21:04,640 --> 00:21:06,730
Of course.

262
00:21:11,520 --> 00:21:16,240
I always believed that if I continued with football...

263
00:21:16,610 --> 00:21:19,160
...if I kept playing and improving...

264
00:21:19,870 --> 00:21:22,080
...one day, I would see Roberto.

265
00:21:40,180 --> 00:21:43,390
The members of the Japanese youth...

